找到关键：`discoverAndLoadExtensions` 的 configuredPaths 分支：

```js
for (const p of configuredPaths) {
    const resolved = resolvePath(p, resolvedCwd, ...);
    if (fs.existsSync(resolved) && fs.statSync(resolved).isDirectory()) {
